# 🧠 Binary Classification Neural Network with PyTorch

In this project, we will build a complete Neural Network using PyTorch.

We will go through the complete Machine Learning / Deep Learning pipeline:

```text
Dataset
   ↓
Separate Features (X) and Target (y)
   ↓
Train / Test Split
   ↓
Preprocessing
   ↓
Convert to PyTorch Tensor
   ↓
Create Neural Network
   ↓
Forward Propagation
   ↓
Calculate Loss
   ↓
Backpropagation
   ↓
Gradient Descent
   ↓
Training
   ↓
Testing
   ↓
Prediction
```

