# 30. Most Important Things to Remember

### Dataset

```text
X = Features
y = Target
```

### Shape

```text
X.shape = (samples, features)

shape[0] = samples
shape[1] = features
```

### Linear Layer

```python
nn.Linear(input_features, output_neurons)
```

### Forward

```text
Input
 ↓
Linear
 ↓
ReLU
 ↓
Linear
 ↓
Sigmoid
 ↓
Prediction
```

### Training

```text
Forward
   ↓
Loss
   ↓
zero_grad()
   ↓
Backward
   ↓
Optimizer Step
   ↓
Repeat
```

### The Core Idea

A Neural Network is basically:

```text
Make Prediction
      ↓
Measure Error
      ↓
Calculate Gradients
      ↓
Update Weights
      ↓
Make Better Prediction
      ↓
Repeat
```

That repeated learning process is called **training**.
